# Twinblade Blessing: double strike deals first-strike damage first (CR 702.4b, 510.4). Bot1's Isamaru (2/2) is blocked by Bot2's
# Grizzly Bears (2/2); Bot1 flashes the Aura onto Isamaru after blockers are declared with Black Lotus' mana: the Bears dies to the
# 2 first-strike damage before it deals any, so Isamaru survives undamaged, where without the Aura both would die. No damage
# carries over to Bot2 (a blocked creature stays blocked). Once the Aura is gone - Bot2 destroys it with Disenchant on turn 4 -
# Isamaru loses double strike again.

